#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Umicom Framework
# File: cmake/UmicomLanguageIntelligencePlatform.cmake
#
# PURPOSE:
#   Complete the provider-neutral native language-intelligence control plane:
#   provider orchestration, routing, request governance, diagnostics/semantic
#   state, workspace indexes, advanced editor intelligence and supervision.
