#   Extend the established umicom_language target. Do not create a competing
#   language stack and do not move reusable language behaviour into Studio.
#
# Created by: Sammy Hegab
# Organisation: Umicom Foundation
# Licence: MIT
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
